   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- Rings of **cartilage** surround the trachea (and bronchi)\n- The function of the cartilage is to **support the airways** and **keep them open** during breathing\n- If they were not present then the sides could collapse inwards when the air pressure inside the tubes drops"
